1
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:57,479
If you knew you would die a violent death at 12 o'clock,

2
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:01,530
would you still come to the island?

3
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:07,700
But without tonight's gathering and negotiation,

4
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:11,020
there would be no chance of success and fame.

5
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:18,360
Who exactly is behind all this,

6
00:02:20,079 --> 00:02:22,940
threatening me with life and death to make a choice?

7
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:40,640
Xiaotao,

8
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,980
didn't I tell you not to come here?

9
00:02:44,320 --> 00:02:45,120
What's wrong?

10
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,520
You look like you're very scared.

11
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,380
The killer will appear here soon.

12
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:50,840
You will be in danger.

13
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:54,720
Besides you,

14
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:57,820
there doesn't seem to be any so-called killer here.

15
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:02,800
Lao Dai.

16
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,360
What did Lao Dai tell you?

17
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:08,080
I know everything.

18
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:13,880
I'll give you one last chance to explain.

19
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:16,079
Xiaotao.

20
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,160
Someone is trying to kill me now.

21
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:20,880
Whatever huge matter it is, we'll talk about it tomorrow.

22
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:21,680
Get up.

23
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:23,920
Tomorrow?

24
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:26,840
How many times have you told me tomorrow?

25
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:29,040
How long are you going to hide it from me?

26
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:31,900
Are you so sure you can leave here alive tonight?

27
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:33,920
Will Mala let you go?

28
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:38,920
You saw Mala?

29
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:40,400
What did Mala tell you?

30
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:42,329
How dare you mention Mala to me.

31
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:46,560
You lied to me for ten years.

32
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:49,160
You lied to me for a whole ten years!

33
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:51,800
When you die,

34
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:53,720
I will tell everyone

35
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:55,840
that I wrote 'The Death of Mala' first.

36
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,920
'The Death of Mala' is my work.

37
00:03:57,920 --> 00:03:59,760
You killed Mala.

38
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:01,220
Don't even think about it.

39
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:12,400
Xiaotao.

40
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:14,560
Xiaotao, are you okay?

41
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:18,240
Xiaotao.

42
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,720
I know it's you, Mala.

43
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:53,880
Xiaotao.

44
00:04:55,159 --> 00:04:56,400
I didn't mean it, Xiaotao.

45
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:57,860
You really want to kill me.

46
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:00,240
You really want to kill me.

47
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,000
Listen to my explanation.

48
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:02,000
This contract...

49
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,000
Xiaotao.

50
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,680
Xiaotao, what are you doing?

51
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:07,210
Xiaotao.

52
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:09,610
What... what are you doing?

53
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:11,800
You'll fall to your death.

54
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:14,520
Tonight in this villa...

55
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:16,800
There can only be one murderer.

56
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:18,760
And that is you,

57
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,400
Li Zhiwei.

58
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:23,280
Xiaotao.

59
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,360
Xiaotao.

60
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:00,760
Xiaotao, wake up.

61
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:02,760
Don't scare me.

62
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:15,960
So,

63
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:18,960
I am the one wearing the helmet.

64
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:05,040
Don't even think about running.

65
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:06,120
Xiaotao, I...

66
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,320
I didn't mean to.

67
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:30,200
Slow down.

68
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:31,520
Help me.

69
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:51,640
Calm down.

70
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,560
Think carefully.

71
00:07:53,880 --> 00:07:55,840
What did you see earlier?

72
00:07:57,920 --> 00:08:00,240
I think I saw a man in black

73
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:02,500
push Xiaotao down from the second floor.

74
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:14,640
So do you think

75
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:16,820
Li Zhiwei is a good person?

76
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,440
I believe him.

77
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:24,160
Hurry up. We need to get out of here as soon as possible.

78
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:42,799
It's Mala.

79
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:44,120
Mala is here.

80
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:45,680
So Mala is not dead yet.

81
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:47,800
Let's go find him.

82
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,640
I'm going to find him.

83
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:51,520
Sophie.

84
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:22,320
Xiaotao.

85
00:09:23,160 --> 00:09:24,680
I didn't mean to kill you.

86
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:32,040
What are you doing?

87
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,940
I admit I didn't want to add your name.

88
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,400
So what?

89
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:48,680
Do you deserve this credit?

90
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:52,840
You finally spoke your mind.
